Install Plan

Components to install
  1. context7 included
     Latest framework and library docs
  2. engram included
     Persistent cross-session memory
  3. selops-operationalmcp included
     SelOps operational MCP server configuration
  4. selops-operator included
     SelOps operator persona (replaces Gentleman persona for OPS agents)
  5. selops-sddops included
     SelOps operational SDD workflow layer

Pi agent support will be installed.
  • Engram component will be installed/provisioned.
  • Pi package stack will be installed:
    - pi install npm:gentle-pi
    - pi install npm:gentle-engram
    - pi install npm:pi-mcp-adapter
    - npm exec --yes --package gentle-engram@0.1.4 -- pi-engram init
    - pi install npm:pi-subagents
    - pi install npm:pi-intercom
    - pi install npm:@juicesharp/rpiv-ask-user-question
    - pi install npm:pi-web-access
    - pi install npm:pi-lens
    - pi install npm:@juicesharp/rpiv-todo
    - pi install npm:pi-btw

